    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that Imani sends the customer email from the helpdesk by Wednesday 2026-11-04, 12:00 PT and Felix shares the workspace export with her by 09:00 PT, with recheck passed. No unresolved items were recorded, and the other remarks were recorded as statements rather than confirmed resolutions.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- It was confirmed that Imani sends the customer email from the helpdesk by Wednesday 2026-11-04, 12:00 PT and Felix shares the workspace export with her by 09:00 PT, as confirmed by Imani, Felix and Sunil with recheck passed.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- It was stated that anyone down over an hour gets a credit.\n- It was stated that the credits would be applied by Thursday.\n- It was stated that the customer emails would be handled by tomorrow.\n- It was stated that the message should include plain language, the credit, and what was changed.\n- It was stated to close out the open tickets once the email is out, pointing to it.\n- It was stated that that would be done with a macro.\n- It was stated that the postmortem would be published on the blog after legal reads it.\n- It was stated that the status page went up twenty minutes late.\n- It was stated that a step for it would be added.\n- It was stated as a question whether those fifteen are inside the two hundred and twelve.\n- It was stated that cross-checking had not been done."
